Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:04:38.54,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 WTA1000 1/8决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:04:38.54,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}佩古拉 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}2 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}4-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}7-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}5{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 科斯蒂亚 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.12,0:00:06.24,EN,,0,0,0,,this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.12,0:00:06.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一次，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.24,0:00:08.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Pegula books a place in the last eight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.24,0:00:08.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,佩古拉锁定1/4决赛席位，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:12.24,EN,,0,0,0,,in Cincy for the third time in five seasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:12.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,五个赛季里第三次打到这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:13.68,EN,,0,0,0,,What a struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:13.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,过程太不容易了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:17.04,EN,,0,0,0,,There'll be a warm exchange at the net.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:17.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,网前两人温暖地拥抱。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.04,0:00:20.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Might be Cirstea's last ever appearance
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.04,0:00:20.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,这可能是科斯蒂亚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:23.44,EN,,0,0,0,,in Cincinnati, but it's going to be one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:23.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,在辛辛那提的最后一次亮相，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.44,0:00:25.84,EN,,0,0,0,,that we will remember for quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.44,0:00:25.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,但会让人记很久。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.84,0:00:30.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Pegula eventually gets over the line having
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.84,0:00:30.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,佩古拉最终跨过了终点线，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.40,0:00:33.12,EN,,0,0,0,,missed multiple opportunities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.40,0:00:33.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,尽管此前错过了好几次机会。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.12,0:00:36.16,EN,,0,0,0,,The fight of Cirstea, but Pegula prevails.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.12,0:00:36.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,拼到最后，赢的是佩古拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.16,0:00:38.40,EN,,0,0,0,,The number three seed is through 75
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.16,0:00:38.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,三号种子七比五拿下决胜盘，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:41.92,EN,,0,0,0,,in the third to the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:41.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,闯进下一轮。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:45.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Jesse, you are just so tough,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:45.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,杰西，你实在是太顽强了，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:48.00,EN,,0,0,0,,so hard to to beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:48.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,太难被打败了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.56,EN,,0,0,0,,She threw everything she had at you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,她把所有招都用来对付你，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.56,0:00:54.40,EN,,0,0,0,,in essentially nothing to lose season,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.56,0:00:54.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,反正也没什么可失去的，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:56.00,EN,,0,0,0,,but here you are standing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:56.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,但站到最后的还是你。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:00:57.36,EN,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:00:57.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是怎么做到的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.36,0:00:57.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.36,0:00:57.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊，我是说，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:00:59.84,EN,,0,0,0,,that was really tough being up a set
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:00:59.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,领先一盘之后真的很难熬，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.84,0:01:02.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and I think a break or I don't know what it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.84,0:01:02.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,好像还破发一次，记不清了，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:04.00,EN,,0,0,0,,was, but I was winning the whole time
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:04.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,但那段时间我一直在赢，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:05.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and I had a feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:05.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我隐约觉得，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.60,0:01:06.96,EN,,0,0,0,,that she was going to loosen up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.60,0:01:06.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,她会慢慢放开手脚，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.96,0:01:08.56,EN,,0,0,0,,and start hitting some and raise her level
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.96,0:01:08.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,打出更好的球，提升水平，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.56,0:01:10.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and hit some better shots and she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.56,0:01:10.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,她确实做到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:11.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I felt like I just lost the momentum
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:11.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我感觉自己在第二盘末尾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.84,0:01:13.52,EN,,0,0,0,,at the end of that second, but credit to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.84,0:01:13.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,丢了节奏，但这要归功于她。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.52,0:01:14.40,EN,,0,0,0,,She started playing, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.52,0:01:14.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,她开始打得，你知道的，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.40,0:01:16.48,EN,,0,0,0,,I think much better, serving much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.40,0:01:16.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,好很多，发球也好很多。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.48,0:01:16.80,EN,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.48,0:01:16.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.80,0:01:18.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and then it just felt like tricky conditions
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.80,0:01:18.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,第三盘感觉条件变得很棘手，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.40,0:01:18.96,EN,,0,0,0,,in the third.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.40,0:01:18.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,很难适应。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.96,0:01:19.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Honestly, it was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.96,0:01:19.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话，感觉有点怪。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.84,0:01:21.04,EN,,0,0,0,,We were breaking a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.84,0:01:21.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们互相破发了好多次。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.04,0:01:22.00,EN,,0,0,0,,It was really windy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.04,0:01:22.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,风真的很大。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.00,0:01:23.52,EN,,0,0,0,,I felt like we were returning well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.00,0:01:23.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我感觉两人的接发都不错，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.52,0:01:24.56,EN,,0,0,0,,It was just really hard to kind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.52,0:01:24.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以真的很难
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.56,0:01:25.68,EN,,0,0,0,,of defend off the serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.56,0:01:25.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,靠发球去防守。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.68,0:01:27.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Even when you hit a good serve,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.68,0:01:27.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,哪怕发出了一记好球，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:28.32,EN,,0,0,0,,I felt like with the wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:28.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,在风里我也感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.32,0:01:30.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I was just a little tentative on some volleys
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.32,0:01:30.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,有些截击球上有点犹豫，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.24,0:01:31.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and overheads and swing volleys,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.24,0:01:31.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,高压和摆浪截击也是，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.60,0:01:32.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and that can get really tough
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.60,0:01:32.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,那样真的很难受，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.80,0:01:34.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and you start secondguessing yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.80,0:01:34.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,会开始怀疑自己。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.40,0:01:36.16,EN,,0,0,0,,But, I think I did a good job there
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.40,0:01:36.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过我觉得自己在最后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.16,0:01:37.92,EN,,0,0,0,,at the end to kind of just push myself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.16,0:01:37.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,做得不错，逼着自己
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.92,0:01:40.64,EN,,0,0,0,,a little bit to to be as aggressive as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.92,0:01:40.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,尽可能地打得更主动一点。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.64,0:01:44.36,EN,,0,0,0,,And it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.64,0:01:44.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且真的奏效了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.76,0:01:48.48,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't think you mind me asking you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.76,0:01:48.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我猜你不会介意
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.48,0:01:50.56,EN,,0,0,0,,something about Sorana.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.48,0:01:50.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我问几句关于索拉娜的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.56,0:01:52.56,EN,,0,0,0,,She's been on tour for 22 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.56,0:01:52.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,她在巡回赛打了二十二年。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:54.00,EN,,0,0,0,,The first time you played,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:54.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们第一次交手，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.00,0:01:57.44,EN,,0,0,0,,we're talking 17-year-old Jesse in Midland.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.00,0:01:57.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是在米德兰，十七岁的你。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:01:59.92,EN,,0,0,0,,But to see her consistency from one
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:01:59.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,但看着她这么多年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.92,0:02:01.68,EN,,0,0,0,,of the most consistent players on tour,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.92,0:02:01.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,是巡回赛最稳定的选手之一，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:03.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you respect what she's doing right
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:03.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我相信你尊重她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.60,0:02:04.16,EN,,0,0,0,,now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.60,0:02:04.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在在做的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.16,0:02:05.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.16,0:02:05.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,哦，那当然。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.04,0:02:06.64,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, she's someone that I have known
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.04,0:02:06.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说，我认识她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.64,0:02:08.48,EN,,0,0,0,,since we were playing challengers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.64,0:02:08.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是打挑战赛的时候，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.48,0:02:09.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and I've seen her come up
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.48,0:02:09.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我看着她一路
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.84,0:02:10.40,EN,,0,0,0,,through the rankings
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.84,0:02:10.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,打上排名榜，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.40,0:02:11.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and then get hurt and come back
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.40,0:02:11.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后受伤又复出，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.84,0:02:13.04,EN,,0,0,0,,and then obviously now kind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.84,0:02:13.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在很明显
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.04,0:02:14.64,EN,,0,0,0,,of on a little bit of a farewell tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.04,0:02:14.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,算是打一场小小的告别巡演。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.64,0:02:15.60,EN,,0,0,0,,We'll see depending
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.64,0:02:15.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,接下来怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:16.56,EN,,0,0,0,,on how well she's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:16.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,要看她自己打得怎么样了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.56,0:02:17.84,EN,,0,0,0,,She's doing pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.56,0:02:17.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,她现在打得还挺好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.84,0:02:19.04,EN,,0,0,0,,But I know she said that, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.84,0:02:19.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我知道她说过，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:20.32,EN,,0,0,0,,this wants to be her last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:20.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,她希望这是她最后一年，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.32,0:02:21.84,EN,,0,0,0,,but I've always had the utmost respect
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.32,0:02:21.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我一直对她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.84,0:02:22.24,EN,,0,0,0,,for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.84,0:02:22.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,抱着最高的敬意。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.24,0:02:24.32,EN,,0,0,0,,She's always super professional,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.24,0:02:24.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,她一直特别职业，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.32,0:02:26.40,EN,,0,0,0,,super nice, just courteous,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.32,0:02:26.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,特别好相处，也很有礼貌，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.40,0:02:28.64,EN,,0,0,0,,and I feel like is is kind of the epitome
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.40,0:02:28.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得她差不多就是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.64,0:02:30.80,EN,,0,0,0,,of like a a professional tennis player
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.64,0:02:30.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,一个职业网球运动员
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.80,0:02:32.32,EN,,0,0,0,,should be, and I've always
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.80,0:02:32.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,该有的样子，我也一直
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.32,0:02:34.24,EN,,0,0,0,,had that to to be around, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.32,0:02:34.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,很庆幸身边有这样的人，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.24,0:02:35.60,EN,,0,0,0,,since we've been playing with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.24,0:02:35.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我们打过很多次交手。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.60,0:02:37.20,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I haven't played her in a really long time
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.60,0:02:37.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过很久没跟她交手了，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.20,0:02:39.12,EN,,0,0,0,,as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.20,0:02:39.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,也是真的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.12,0:02:40.56,EN,,0,0,0,,So, beautifully said.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.12,0:02:40.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,这话说得真好。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.56,0:02:42.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's been about five years
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.56,0:02:42.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊，距离你们上一次交手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.48,0:02:43.92,EN,,0,0,0,,since the two of you have played.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.48,0:02:43.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,差不多已经五年了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.92,0:02:45.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Got to ask just a couple
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.92,0:02:45.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,还得问你几个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.52,0:02:47.36,EN,,0,0,0,,of personal questions just getting all up
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.52,0:02:47.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,有点私人的问题，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:48.24,EN,,0,0,0,,in your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:48.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,打探一下你的生活。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.24,0:02:50.00,EN,,0,0,0,,So, after every match,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.24,0:02:50.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,每次比赛结束以后，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.00,0:02:51.52,EN,,0,0,0,,you have a fascinating routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.00,0:02:51.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你都有一套很有意思的流程。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.52,0:02:51.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Is it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.52,0:02:51.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.92,0:02:54.80,EN,,0,0,0,,the same every time you open something,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.92,0:02:54.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,每次都一样，先打开东西，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.80,0:02:56.00,EN,,0,0,0,,you put something on your hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.80,0:02:56.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,在手上戴点什么，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:02:57.04,EN,,0,0,0,,you check your phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:02:57.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后看看手机？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.04,0:02:57.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Do you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.04,0:02:57.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,你有没有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.44,0:03:00.00,EN,,0,0,0,,have a consistent postmatch routine there
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.44,0:03:00.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,一套固定的赛后流程，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.00,0:03:01.04,EN,,0,0,0,,at the bench?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.00,0:03:01.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,就在场边？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.04,0:03:02.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Yes, I put my wedding ring back
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.04,0:03:02.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,有的，我会先把婚戒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.64,0:03:06.00,EN,,0,0,0,,on and I power up my phone
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.64,0:03:06.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,戴回去，再打开手机，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.00,0:03:08.64,EN,,0,0,0,,and then I usually come and talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.00,0:03:08.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后一般就会过来跟你聊天。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.64,0:03:09.76,EN,,0,0,0,,That's pretty much it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.64,0:03:09.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,基本就这些。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.76,0:03:10.48,EN,,0,0,0,,And honestly,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.76,0:03:10.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.48,0:03:12.40,EN,,0,0,0,,this is putting my ring on is out of habit
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.48,0:03:12.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,戴戒指纯粹是习惯，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.40,0:03:14.08,EN,,0,0,0,,because I lose a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.40,0:03:14.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我特别爱丢东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.08,0:03:15.92,EN,,0,0,0,,And I have actually lost this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.08,0:03:15.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,这枚戒指我之前真的丢过。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:17.60,EN,,0,0,0,,And by an absolute miracle,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:17.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,说来是个奇迹，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.60,0:03:18.88,EN,,0,0,0,,story for another day,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.60,0:03:18.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个故事改天再讲，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.88,0:03:20.40,EN,,0,0,0,,I found it like in the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.88,0:03:20.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我居然在街上把它找回来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.40,0:03:21.36,EN,,0,0,0,,somebody found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.40,0:03:21.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,是有人捡到还给了我。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.36,0:03:24.08,EN,,0,0,0,,And so my husband was not very happy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.36,0:03:24.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我丈夫当时
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.08,0:03:26.48,EN,,0,0,0,,with that, as you can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.08,0:03:26.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,很不高兴，你能想象的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.48,0:03:28.56,EN,,0,0,0,,So I've become very habitual
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.48,0:03:28.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我现在已经很习惯，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:29.76,EN,,0,0,0,,with putting my wedding ring back
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:29.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,会把婚戒戴回去，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.76,0:03:31.92,EN,,0,0,0,,on because he knows, everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.76,0:03:31.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为他知道，认识我的人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.92,0:03:33.92,EN,,0,0,0,,that knows me knows I just lose stuff all
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.92,0:03:33.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,都知道我总是丢三落四，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.92,0:03:35.12,EN,,0,0,0,,the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.92,0:03:35.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直如此，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:36.40,EN,,0,0,0,,except tennis matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:36.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,除了网球比赛不会输。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.40,0:03:37.52,EN,,0,0,0,,One more quick thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.40,0:03:37.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,再问最后一个小问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.52,0:03:43.76,EN,,0,0,0,,It's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.52,0:03:43.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,有点意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.76,0:03:44.88,EN,,0,0,0,,I I've known you for a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.76,0:03:44.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我认识你这么久了，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.88,0:03:46.72,EN,,0,0,0,,but I have no clue what the answer
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.88,0:03:46.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,但完全猜不到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.72,0:03:48.64,EN,,0,0,0,,to this question will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.72,0:03:48.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个问题的答案。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.64,0:03:50.88,EN,,0,0,0,,What's playing in your headphones
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.64,0:03:50.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,你走上球场的时候，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:52.16,EN,,0,0,0,,when you walk out on court?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:52.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,耳机里放的是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.16,0:03:53.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Do you have a walk out song
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.16,0:03:53.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,有没有固定的出场曲，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:55.12,EN,,0,0,0,,or does it change all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:55.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是一直在换？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.12,0:03:56.56,EN,,0,0,0,,It changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.12,0:03:56.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直在换。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.56,0:03:58.40,EN,,0,0,0,,I feel like with usually like a week
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.56,0:03:58.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,一般大概一两周
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.40,0:04:00.24,EN,,0,0,0,,or two it might stay the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.40,0:04:00.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,会维持不变。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.24,0:04:02.56,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.24,0:04:02.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也说不好。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:02.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Right now
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:02.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在这段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.96,0:04:04.72,EN,,0,0,0,,it's it's always pretty relaxing music
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.96,0:04:04.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,放的一直是比较放松的音乐，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.72,0:04:07.04,EN,,0,0,0,,that like more viby, not super intense,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.72,0:04:07.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,氛围感更强，不会太激烈，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:07.68,EN,,0,0,0,,not super rap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:07.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,也不是那种劲爆说唱。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.68,0:04:09.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I listen to like a lot of R&B.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.68,0:04:09.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我听挺多R&B的，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.68,0:04:10.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Sometimes it's afrobeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.68,0:04:10.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时候是非洲节拍。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:12.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Sometimes it's Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:12.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时候是……对。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.24,0:04:13.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Something really laidback.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.24,0:04:13.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,反正就是很放松的那种。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.68,0:04:16.56,EN,,0,0,0,,So, this week I don't even know what it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.68,0:04:16.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,这周放的是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.56,0:04:17.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't even know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.56,0:04:17.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我自己都说不上来。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.28,0:04:19.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I think it's Amber Mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.28,0:04:19.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,好像是安柏·马克。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.68,0:04:20.64,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't know if that's her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.68,0:04:20.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,也不确定是不是她的名字。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.64,0:04:22.00,EN,,0,0,0,,I think that's her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.64,0:04:22.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,应该是这个名字。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.00,0:04:23.52,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't know. She's not very well known yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.00,0:04:23.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,不确定，她现在还没名气。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.52,0:04:24.56,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for her to blow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.52,0:04:24.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就等着她红起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.56,0:04:25.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I should probably know her name
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.56,0:04:25.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我大概应该记住她的名字，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.68,0:04:27.20,EN,,0,0,0,,though if I'm waiting for that to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.68,0:04:27.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,毕竟我都在等这一天了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.20,0:04:28.40,EN,,0,0,0,,But she's been really good
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.20,0:04:28.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,但她真的写得很好，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.40,0:04:30.64,EN,,0,0,0,,and I've been listening to a lot of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.40,0:04:30.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我最近听了她很多歌。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.64,0:04:31.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, she will blow up
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.64,0:04:31.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,那她肯定会红的，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.68,0:04:33.52,EN,,0,0,0,,since you just gave her a shout out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.68,0:04:33.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,毕竟你刚给她打了广告。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.52,0:04:34.88,EN,,0,0,0,,As much variety in her music
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.52,0:04:34.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,她音乐里的多样性，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.88,0:04:35.60,EN,,0,0,0,,as in her game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.88,0:04:35.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,和她球风里的一样丰富。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.60,0:04:38.54,EN,,0,0,0,,Show some love for Jessica Pegula.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.60,0:04:38.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,把掌声送给佩古拉。
